  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On behalf of Irish Embassy Manila -Irish Aid Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims for the adoption and implementation of the updated National Invasive Species Strategic Action Plan (NISSAP) by government stakeholders and communities. The updated NISSAP will serve as a blueprint in mitigating invasive species threats to livelihoods and ecosystems in Palau and to strengthen the capacity of stakeholders and communities in delivering effective sustainable invasive species management on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
